### Telecom bill run API – IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
@api = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Start a bill run (202 + Location)
POST {{api}}/bill-runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-User: alice

{"cycle":"2026-09"}

### Same cycle while active -> 409
POST {{api}}/bill-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{"cycle":"2026-09"}

### List jobs (newest first)
GET {{api}}/jobs?size=10

### Running jobs only
GET {{api}}/jobs?status=RUNNING

### One job: status, percent, rate, ETA, checkpoint
GET {{api}}/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### SSE progress stream
GET {{api}}/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_ID/progress
Accept: text/event-stream

### Cooperative cancel (stops after the current chunk)
POST {{api}}/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_ID/cancel

### Forced cancel (interrupts the worker; current chunk rolls back)
POST {{api}}/jobs/REPLACE_WITH_ID/cancel?force=true

### Invoices produced for a cycle
GET {{api}}/bill-runs/2026-09/summary
